 "description": "<p>Ten levels of frequency control govern the suction here, adjustable in fine steps rather than big jumps — the difference between dialing a setting and landing on it. Powerful airflow pull is the working principle: air pulses around the clitoris instead of surface friction, which is the sensation the rose category exists to deliver.</p>\n<p><img style=\"float: none\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_11_480x480.jpg?v=1692585614\"></p>\n<p>The body keeps to a compact, lightweight frame that fits a closed fist, and the portability is genuine rather than marketing: this is a rose that lives in a travel bag without announcing itself through weight or bulk.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_13_480x480.jpg?v=1692585620\"></p>\n<p>Premium silicone over durable ABS handles both the softness at the contact end and the structure underneath, a pairing chosen for surviving the wash cycle that daily use demands. Hygiene and comfort are the two promises, and both materials keep them.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Suction levels: 10-step frequency control</li>\n<li>Size: compact and lightweight</li>\n<li>Material: premium silicone + ABS</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_9_480x480.jpg?v=1692585605\"></p>\n<p>The plain, competent rose — no gimmick layer, nothing missing from the core job.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Compact suction rose vibrator with 10-level frequency control, premium silicone contact end and a lightweight body built for travel.</p>\n",
